# Production build configuration.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the bundle at build time, not read at
# startup — so this must be present when `next build` runs, and changing it
# requires a rebuild rather than a restart. .env.local is gitignored, which is
# why a deployed build previously fell back to the default in src/lib/const.ts.
#
# The websocket URL is derived from this, so the two cannot disagree.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://tempo-be.vihangaw.xyz
